        "text": "Spicing Things Up with Cinnamon\nIn Chapter 4, I mention that there was great angst in the Linux world with the\nrelease of the GNOME 3 desktop. Many hardcore Linux users were perfectly com-\nfortable with the look-and-feel of GNOME 2, and the desktop paradigm change\nintroduced by GNOME 3 upset their worlds.\nIN THIS CHAPTER\n\u00bb\n\u00bb  The Cinnamon desktop\n\u00bb\n\u00bb  Examining the MATE desktop\n\u00bb\n\u00bb  The simplicity of the Xfce desktop\n102   PART 1 Getting Your Feet Wet\nThis gave rise to some new desktops that were spin-offs from the original GNOME\ndesktop. Cinnamon is one of those spin-offs. This section walks through the\nbasics of the Cinnamon desktop.\nEsta secci\u00f3n contiene las siguientes subsecciones\n\u2022 History of Cinnamon\n\u2022 Looking at the menu\n\u2022 Changing settings\n\u2022 Adding more spice\nSi deseas explorar cualquiera de estas subsecciones, puedes pregunt\u00e1rmelo directamente.",
